---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About ExamHub.pk | Trusted Exam Preparation Platform"
  description="Learn about ExamHub.pk's mission to provide high-quality, ad-free competitive exam preparation resources for Pakistani students."
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">About ExamHub.pk</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-300">
        Trusted platform for Pakistani competitive exam preparation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      ExamHub.pk is dedicated to making high-quality, comprehensive exam preparation resources accessible to all Pakistani students aspiring to succeed in competitive exams like CSS, PMS, PPSC, FPSC, NTS, and others.
    </p>

    <h2>What We Offer</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>500+ Quality MCQs:</strong> Each with detailed explanations and exam analysis</li>
      <li><strong>Comprehensive Guides:</strong> Deep-dive study materials covering all major subjects</li>
      <li><strong>Subject-wise Organization:</strong> Find resources by subject, exam, or difficulty level</li>
      <li><strong>Exam-Specific Content:</strong> Tailored preparation for CSS, PMS, PPSC, FPSC, and more</li>
      <li><strong>100% Original Content:</strong> All materials created by education experts</li>
      <li><strong>Regularly Updated:</strong> Content refreshed with latest exam patterns and trends</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our Team</h2>
    <p>
      ExamHub.pk is managed by experienced educators, former civil servants, and competitive exam specialists who understand exactly what it takes to succeed in Pakistani competitive exams. All content is thoroughly reviewed for accuracy and alignment with official syllabi.
    </p>

    <h2>Why Choose ExamHub.pk?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Quality First:</strong> Every page contains substantial, original, high-quality content</li>
      <li><strong>Exam-Focused:</strong> Content designed specifically for Pakistani exam patterns</li>
      <li><strong>Free Resources:</strong> No subscription barriers or locked content</li>
      <li><strong>Student-Friendly:</strong> Easy to navigate, mobile-optimized, fast loading</li>
      <li><strong>AdSense Compliant:</strong> Clean design, no intrusive ads or misleading layouts</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Covering All Major Exams</h2>
    <p>
      Whether you're preparing for the prestigious CSS exam, provincial services (PPSC, SPSC, KPPSC), FPSC tests, NTS exams, or ISSB interviews, ExamHub.pk has organized resources to help you succeed.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact & Support</h2>
    <p>
      Have questions or feedback? <a href="/contact">Get in touch with our team</a> anytime. We're constantly improving our resources based on student feedback.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
